{"4682670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HELIOBIOTIC", "steam_appid": 4682670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Investigate, Die, Repeat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > After your ship crash-lands, you find yourself in the eye of an impenetrable storm, stranded on an archipelago floating over an endless abyss. Tasked with a reconnaissance mission you no longer recall, explore each island to escape from this planet's mysterious time loop. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unravel an Ancient Mystery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Lush, overgrown ruins litter the world, the remnants of an ancient civilization that has seemingly vanished. Solve the puzzles they left behind to unearth what ravaged their world. Discover their history to learn your role in their future. <span class=\"bb_strike\">Disobey your programming for the greater good.</span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adapt to an Alien World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Sprint through abandoned alien cities, find secret shortcuts, and grapple across vibrant deserts in a fast-paced race against the clock. Master an intricate movement system and refine your relationship to the environment to venture further every loop.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Investigate, Die, Repeat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > After your ship crash-lands, you find yourself in the eye of an impenetrable storm, stranded on an archipelago floating over an endless abyss. Tasked with a reconnaissance mission you no longer recall, explore each island to escape from this planet's mysterious time loop. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unravel an Ancient Mystery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Lush, overgrown ruins litter the world, the remnants of an ancient civilization that has seemingly vanished. Solve the puzzles they left behind to unearth what ravaged their world. Discover their hist